+      "                                CF:  19.96, Amp:  0.269, BW:  7.23                                \n",
+      "                                                                                                  \n",
+      "                                     Goodness of fit metrics:                                     \n",
+      "                                    R^2 of model fit is 0.9989                                    \n",
+      "                                Root mean squared error is 0.0142                                 \n",
+      "                                                                                                  \n",
+      "==================================================================================================\n"
+     ]
+    },
+    {
+     "data": {
+      "image/png": "\n",
+      "text/plain": [
+       "<matplotlib.figure.Figure at 0x1161cdb38>"
+      ]
+     },
+     "metadata": {},
+     "output_type": "display_data"
+    }
+   ],
+   "source": [
+    "# Print results and plot extracted FOOOF model fit\n",
+    "fm.print_results()\n",
+    "fm.plot()"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {
+    "collapsed": true
+   },
+   "source": [
+    "<hr>\n",
+    "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n",
+    "To continue with the tutorial, with more examples of setting parameters, getting good fits, and troubleshooting issues, go [here](05-Tuning&Troubleshooting.ipynb).\n",
+    "</div>"
+   ]
+  }
